{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46168","headline":"东阳罹乱後怀王慥使君五首 二 · 贯休","name":"东阳罹乱後怀王慥使君五首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"只报精兵过大河，东西南北杀人多。\n可怜白日浑如此，来似蝗虫争奈何。\n天意岂应容版乱，人心都改太凋讹。\n不胜惆怅还惆怅，一曲东风月胯歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46168.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46168","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}